# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instead of obtaining the SK problem from a library as we do for the [Market Split problem](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), you formulate it directly.\n"
msgstr "Alih-alih memperoleh masalah SK dari library seperti yang kita lakukan untuk [masalah Market Split](/tutorials/parity-twine-optimizer-ms), Anda merumuskannya secara langsung.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `generate_sk_problem` function formulates the SK problem directly in the required dictionary format. The only input required is `n`, the number of spins in the model.\n"
msgstr "Fungsi `generate_sk_problem` merumuskan masalah SK secara langsung dalam format dictionary yang diperlukan. Satu-satunya input yang diperlukan adalah `n`, jumlah spin dalam model.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the function `_generate_couplings_sk_model` to calculate the random coupling terms in the SK model. For more control over the couplings, you can use optional arguments, which are explained in the function's docstring.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan fungsi `_generate_couplings_sk_model` untuk menghitung suku kopling acak dalam model SK. Untuk kontrol lebih lanjut atas kopling, Anda dapat menggunakan argumen opsional, yang dijelaskan dalam docstring fungsi tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Solve the problem using the Parity Twine Optimizer {#step-2-solve-the-problem-using-the-parity-twine-optimizer}"
msgstr "Langkah 2: Selesaikan masalah menggunakan Parity Twine Optimizer {#step-2-solve-the-problem-using-the-parity-twine-optimizer}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "With the functions above, you can set up the SK problem and a find solution by using the Twine Optimizer and a chosen IBM Quantum&reg; backend.\n"
msgstr "Dengan fungsi-fungsi di atas, Anda dapat menyiapkan masalah SK dan menemukan solusi dengan menggunakan Twine Optimizer dan backend IBM Quantum&reg; pilihan Anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To run the function, choose a suitable backend; for example, ibm_phoenix.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan fungsi tersebut, pilih backend yang sesuai; misalnya, ibm_phoenix.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optionally, use options for additional control over the submission:\n"
msgstr "Secara opsional, gunakan options untuk kontrol tambahan atas pengiriman:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where `shots` is an integer that specifies the number of circuit executions, `postprocessing_level` determines if post-processing is applied to the result,\n"
"`transpile_only` chooses if the problem is only transpiled to a circuit (and not solved), and `job_tags` is label to identify the job on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana `shots` adalah bilangan bulat yang menentukan jumlah eksekusi circuit, `postprocessing_level` menentukan apakah post-processing diterapkan pada hasil,\n"
"`transpile_only` memilih apakah masalah hanya ditranspilasi menjadi circuit (dan tidak diselesaikan), dan `job_tags` adalah label untuk mengidentifikasi job pada IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The size of the SK model is defined by $N$, the number of interacting spins. Once you choose $N$, the code above generates the problem for `n_spins`.\n"
msgstr "Ukuran model SK didefinisikan oleh $N$, jumlah spin yang berinteraksi. Setelah Anda memilih $N$, kode di atas menghasilkan masalah untuk `n_spins`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the optimizer:\n"
msgstr "Jalankan optimizer:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check the job status:\n"
msgstr "Periksa status job:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retrieve results:\n"
msgstr "Ambil hasil:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result is of form:\n"
msgstr "Hasilnya berbentuk:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"where the `solution` dictionary corresponds to the qubits defined in the problem and gives their optimized spin values for the SK model Hamiltonian.\n"
"This specific sequence of spins in the optimal solution represents the configuration that minimizes the total system energy based on the given random interaction strengths.\n"
"In the SK model, this can be regarded as the lowest energy state of a disordered magnetic system.\n"
msgstr ""
"di mana dictionary `solution` berkorespondensi dengan qubit yang didefinisikan dalam masalah dan memberikan nilai spin yang dioptimalkan untuk Hamiltonian model SK.\n"
"Urutan spin tertentu dalam solusi optimal ini merepresentasikan konfigurasi yang meminimalkan total energi sistem berdasarkan kekuatan interaksi acak yang diberikan.\n"
"Dalam model SK, ini dapat dianggap sebagai keadaan energi terendah dari sistem magnetik yang tidak teratur.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26
